2 PAGE C. H. Hulsey to Martha Singleton, 18 Dec 1893, Paulding County
1 NOTE [Added by Claude research, 3 Sep 2026] Census trail: 1900 Eutah/Tallapoosa/Union districts, Paulding Co. (with Martha E., Drucilla 9, Sally S 5, Jesse H P 2); 1910 Brownings, Polk Co., widower, with Ducilla 18, Sallie 15, Homer 12, Adalee 9, Clarrt
2 CONC on 6 (b. Texas), Ezekel 2 - father Jennings K Hulsey age 70 enumerated nearby; 1920 Gill, Meriwether Co., with Albert 15 (b. Texas), Ezekial 12 and married daughter Drucilla Davis 28; 1930 Rough Edge, Talbot Co., with grandchildren Lilian Davis 1
2 CONC 4 and Artha Davis 9. Two sons born in Texas c.1904-05 show the family lived there briefly. Gravestone inscription &apos;95 years old&apos; conflicts with the 1867 birth. Buried with wife Martha E. and daughter Drusilla.
