2 CONT [Added by Claude research, 3 Sep 2026 - round 2] Census ages give birth c.1825-27 NC (tree has 22 Jun 1824 Rowan Co.). Her sister Roseanna (Rosetta) Deel married Larkin&apos;s brother Richard Sisson c.1833 - two Sisson brothers married two Deal sis
2 CONC ters. A &apos;DEAL, Simon&apos; and &apos;DEAL, William&apos; appear in the Bulloch Co. marriage index but the Deal/Deel family here is the Rowan Co., NC one. Widowed 1862; head of household in Wilkes Co. in 1870.
